#
# Whether a sale on credit is allowed, in Sutra (mercer_rules.h MR3): the
# sale 1 to 2^53 - 1 minor units, the declared limit 0 to 2^53 - 1, and
# room (limit - balance - sale) not below zero. Every field is s9(18): a
# value past 18 digits either way is a size error, refused, where
# credit.eve answers FALSE: held. The sale goes on the customer's account
# only when both say TRUE.
record credit-sale
  sale: s9(18)
  limit: s9(18)
  room: s9(18)
procedure
  answer sale >= 1 and sale <= 9007199254740991 and limit >= 0 and limit <= 9007199254740991 and room >= 0
